# Optional server-only overrides.
#
# The API loads the repository root `.env` first. Copy this file to
# apps/server/.env only when you intentionally need a local override for the
# server package. Do not duplicate real secrets here without a reason.
#
# See ../../.env.example for the complete supported environment configuration.

# Example overrides:
# LOG_LEVEL=trace
# API_PORT=5002
# WEB_URL=http://localhost:3000
